cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "prolly-rdf"
abstract: >-
  RDF storage on content-addressed prolly trees: dictionary-encoded terms, four
  SPOC permutation indexes, commit-DAG versioning with branches, tags, merge and
  time-travel reads, and a worst-case-optimal leapfrog triejoin for cyclic basic
  graph patterns — exposed as an Eclipse RDF4J Sail.
type: software
version: 0.2.0-BETA
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/prollygraph/prolly-rdf"
authors:
